Bug 2061199 - Add writable calendar selection. r=#thunderbird-front-end-reviewers

Add a native calendar selector with calendar names and colors, usable defaults, move-permission checks, and Redux-driven draft updates. Reject results and selections from old operations.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332509


